{"4475480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shattered Void Online", "steam_appid": 4475480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shattered Void</strong> is a 5v5 space combat game where you captain your own capital ship in a five-ship strike fleet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every ship is different </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hero shooter where the heroes are capital ships. Pick your role, not just your loadout. Each of the five classes flies, fights, and wins differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreadnought</strong> — anchor the line and soak the damage your fleet can't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/5b6fdeea519139de8d8cdc42ff787b26.poster.avif?t=1788188295\" aria-label=\"Capital Ship Combat\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/5b6fdeea519139de8d8cdc42ff787b26.webm?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/5b6fdeea519139de8d8cdc42ff787b26.mp4?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroyer</strong> — charged railguns for surgical burst damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/a4262bd8e7b2cb17a5d24de7ec203b9a.poster.avif?t=1788188295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/a4262bd8e7b2cb17a5d24de7ec203b9a.webm?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/a4262bd8e7b2cb17a5d24de7ec203b9a.mp4?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frigate</strong> — repair beams keep your fleet in the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/b1bb22a13e61867686a8d26dc3ea9e5c.poster.avif?t=1788188295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/b1bb22a13e61867686a8d26dc3ea9e5c.webm?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/b1bb22a13e61867686a8d26dc3ea9e5c.mp4?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interceptor</strong> — cloak, flank, and delete the backline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/5bbb31ecd2d5957ba94ccd1dbc4b9008.poster.avif?t=1788188295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/5bbb31ecd2d5957ba94ccd1dbc4b9008.webm?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/5bbb31ecd2d5957ba94ccd1dbc4b9008.mp4?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carrier</strong> — command drone squadrons from behind the wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/024686a5a4bc4eb92e94b50d1bd4ce73.poster.avif?t=1788188295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/024686a5a4bc4eb92e94b50d1bd4ce73.webm?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/024686a5a4bc4eb92e94b50d1bd4ce73.mp4?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture the sectors. Control the map.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sectors are the war: capture them to score, fortify them with automated turrets, and defend them or watch the map flip against you. Zone Capture is the flagship mode; Elimination and King of the Hill sharpen the same fight into pure combat and a single contested point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the line breaks — jump</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy fleets contest everything: cloaked flankers ambush your backline, drone swarms roll over a flank, siege beams pin your push. Charge your jump drive, warp across the battlefield, and arrive where the line is breaking — with your whole fleet behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the void yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock eight captains through 50 achievements, earn credits every match, and christen your ship in the Void Registry — your ship's name flies in gold for every player who sees it fall or fly. Matchmaking matches start fast and stay competitive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shattered Void</strong> is a 5v5 space combat game where you captain your own capital ship in a five-ship strike fleet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every ship is different </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hero shooter where the heroes are capital ships. Pick your role, not just your loadout. Each of the five classes flies, fights, and wins differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreadnought</strong> — anchor the line and soak the damage your fleet can't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/5b6fdeea519139de8d8cdc42ff787b26.poster.avif?t=1788188295\" aria-label=\"Capital Ship Combat\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/5b6fdeea519139de8d8cdc42ff787b26.webm?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/5b6fdeea519139de8d8cdc42ff787b26.mp4?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroyer</strong> — charged railguns for surgical burst damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/a4262bd8e7b2cb17a5d24de7ec203b9a.poster.avif?t=1788188295\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/a4262bd8e7b2cb17a5d24de7ec203b9a.webm?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/extras/a4262bd8e7b2cb17a5d24de7ec203b9a.mp4?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frigate</strong> — repair beams keep your fleet in the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://