/024686a5a4bc4eb92e94b50d1bd4ce73.mp4?t=1788188295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture the sectors. Control the map.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sectors are the war: capture them to score, fortify them with automated turrets, and defend them or watch the map flip against you. Zone Capture is the flagship mode; Elimination and King of the Hill sharpen the same fight into pure combat and a single contested point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the line breaks — jump</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy fleets contest everything: cloaked flankers ambush your backline, drone swarms roll over a flank, siege beams pin your push. Charge your jump drive, warp across the battlefield, and arrive where the line is breaking — with your whole fleet behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the void yours</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock eight captains through 50 achievements, earn credits every match, and christen your ship in the Void Registry — your ship's name flies in gold for every player who sees it fall or fly. Matchmaking matches start fast and stay competitive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Free to Play: Command powerful capital ships in fast-paced 5v5 space combat. Choose from five ship classes — from nimble Interceptors to massive Carriers — capture sectors, outmaneuver your enemies, and dominate the void.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/38a234b6a1dd3faf46377ee427e161268a4b619c/header.jpg?t=1788188295", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/8ff6edddc3600fe8285c483281c18377f137d053/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788188295", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475480/8ff6edddc36